  The full set in src/webui/api/serialize/serialize_torrent.cpp: `error`, `missingFiles`, `uploading`, `stoppedUP`, `queuedUP`, `stalledUP`, `checkingUP`, `forcedUP`, `downloading`, `metaDL`, `forcedMetaDL`, `stoppedDL`, `queuedDL`, `stalledDL`, `checkingDL`, `forcedDL`, `checkingResumeData`, `moving`, and a default of `unknown`. There is no `pausedUP` or `pausedDL`.

